  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "Figs 28 and 29, current-state (December 2023) and future-state supply chain systems in Malawi. Current state: OpenHIM, a master health facility registry, national product catalogue and terminology services, DHIS2, QAT and QuanTB for forecasting, OpenLMIS for orders, Navision for warehouse and procurement, eHIN for dispensing, cStock for inventory, GFPVAN outside. Future state: a supplier registry, supply chain reports, a data warehouse, track and trace and product verification are added; E-GP for procurement and contracts, a new transportation system, OpenLMIS and cStock at facility level, and parallel supply chains among external systems.",
